window.products.push({"id":822185,"name":"Aymei Kintchen Vegetable Peeler 3 Piece Set, Straight Peeler, Serrated Peeler, Julienne Peeler, Multifunctional Veggie and Fruit Peeler,Set of 3 Piece","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":8.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NPSCz1h+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Aymei is a professional company focusing on exquisite life, developing and selling exquisite furniture and kitchen tools and equipment. We will be in the pursuit of excellence, customer first principle to continue to provide quality services. Aymei vegetable and fruit peeler set has a one handle and 3 replaceable function parts. This handle fits for all of them, you just need to choose right use for corresponding ingredients. Peelers design works for right and left hand. Large peeler This large peeler can helps you shredding cabbage, make large slices of cheese and preferred vegetables prepare your favorite salads. Julienne peeler With our julienne peeler it is easier to make zucchini noodles and pumpkin spaghetti and carrot julienne. Standart peeler This peeler help you with peeling any fruits or vegetables like apples, carrots or potatoes .This peeler is indispensable helper in your kitchen! Warning :Not for children! The blades are very sharp. Always keep blades away from fingers and body. When peelers are not in use, store in a safe place.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61NPSCz1h+L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Nonbrand","source_asin":"B08C9RHD2T","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822185","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08C9RHD2T","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08C9RHD2T","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822186,"name":"Bloss Static Cling Window Film Bamboo Artificial Avoiding Glass Burst for Meeting Rome/Living Room/Kitchen/Bathroom/Sitting Room/Bedroom/Glass Door, 1","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jECSEYyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","description":"Bloss's self adhesive privacy window film is very easy to apply, virtually mess-free and there's no adhesive, so it's removable! This window film works on glass, door panels and even bathroom door. Nature light can pass through, so no dark areas are created, and you have instant privacy! For windows there's the added benefit that this vinyl film blocks heat glare and harmful UV rays. Your decorative privacy film is not affected by moisture and steam from temperature changes or showers, no peeling, no bubbling, just a beautiful window decal for many years. Your window treatment and privacy problems have just been solved! What included: 1 x Window film (17.7-inch by 78.7-inch) 1 x Installation Instruction How to install? 1. Measure glass. 2. Trim the window film to required size. It’s better to cut 0.5 inch more for second cutting. 3. Clean the glass with soup water to keep the glass clean and smooth. 4. Wet glass with plenty of water. It is good for reducing air bubbles. 5. Peel off the transparent backing film, and then spray water on the back side (Smooth side). Then set up it on the glass. 6. Squeegee away water and air bubbles from center to the sides. 7. Cut off margins. NOTES: 1. This product is only suitable for smooth glass. Not recommended for frosted glass, art glass, curved glass, etc. 2. This product can be used for office and home, bathroom, kitchen, doors, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/710jECSEYyL._AC_SL1000_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bloss","source_asin":"B01BVB7FT0","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822186","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01BVB7FT0","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01BVB7FT0","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
