window.products.push({"id":822296,"name":"FAMI LED Wine Champagne Flute Glasses, (Set of 6 Multi-Color) Water Liquid Activated Flashing Light Up Cup Blinking Cocktail Whisky Drinkware Glow Mug","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":24.29,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L4cJp0j8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Liquid Activated - Two tiny pins on the bottom to activate the LED, LED lights up when liquid is poured into the cup, lights off once the cup is empty. A pretty effect as the colored light reflects off the sparkly crystals embedded in the bottom of the glass, then shines through the liquid in the glass. SAFE - Made of food-grade plastic material,The safety approval BPA-Free plastic material means there are no adverse effects on human health. The safety approval BPA-Free plastic material AND there are no adverse effects on human health. Safe for drinking. CAPACITY and COLOR - 5.30 oz, Set comes with 6 copas de plastico para brindis all with their own unique color LED light. Include: Pink, Yellow, Red, Green, Blue and Colorful. The led’s life can last for 24 hours in total with CR1220 button batteries. It can also be a normal Champagne glass. Perfect Gift - Champagne glasses make for an awesome Christmas gift! Colorful LED Cups create a festive mood and a decorative way to serve champagne or wine, Perfect for club decorations,Halloween decorations, house decoration uses, bar birthday decorations, parties decorations, characteristics, wedding party POWER - Batteries included and pre-installed","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71L4cJp0j8L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"FAMI","source_asin":"B0107UXAL8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822296","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0107UXAL8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0107UXAL8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822297,"name":"The Museum Store Small Sobek","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hrL2+f13L._AC_.jpg","description":"The name Sobek means crocodile. He was a crocodile god much favored by the kings of the twelfth and thirteenth dynasties. Many of the rulers of this period chose to bear names such as Sobek-Hotep, which means ìSobek is mercifulî. His main place of worship was in the Nome of Faiyum of which he was the patron deity. His temple there had a holy lake where a sacred crocodile named Pet-Sobek ìhe who belongs to Sobekî was kept. He was also worshipped at Kom Ombo, where he replaced Seth in a triad of gods, becoming the husband of Hathor and the father of Khonsu. He had associations with the god Horus and a further identification with Ra led to a form of the crocodile with the solar disk on his head. He was usually represented as either a crocodile or a man with a crocodileís head. Sobek was understandably a god of the water, the Nile river issued from his sweat. He ìmade the herbage greenî and therefore took on a somewhat Osirian character.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/41hrL2+f13L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"The Museum","source_asin":"B000H23MOM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822297","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B000H23MOM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B000H23MOM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
