window.products.push({"id":822327,"name":"Arthur: Love is Love - 16 oz. Pint Glass - Set of 4","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l+zcevEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Mr. Ratburn and Patrick are key characters featured from the beloved TV series, Arthur, on this officially licensed pint glass. Mr. Ratburn (Nigel Charles Ratburn) is Arthur's third and fourth grade teacher. He attended Glenbrook where his passion for learning and teaching was guided by his teacher, Mr. Pryce-Jones. Various running gags involving Mr. Ratburn are of his strictness and love of homework, food, and dessert (especially cake). He usually drives a small red convertible but also bought a minivan and canoe online. In the Season 22 episode \"Mr. Ratburn and the Special Someone\", Mr. Ratburn is revealed to be gay when he marries his same-sex partner, Patrick, in a wedding attended by his students. Arthur has been airing on PBS for 25 years and is based on the books series by Marc Brown.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81l+zcevEoL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Arthur","source_asin":"B085LRDRHM","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822327","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B085LRDRHM","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B085LRDRHM","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822328,"name":"Vegetable and Fruit Chopper with 3 Stainless Steel Blades, Adjustable Slicer & Dicer With Storage Container and Non-Skid Base, by Tiabo","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612101zd6aL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","description":"CHOP, SLICE, DICE AND STORE. REPEAT! ONLY WITH THE JOBOX MAGIC CHOPPER! Sometimes all you need to make an amazing meal are amazing tools. With the proper instruments at your disposal, you can get things done quickly and effectively, so that dinner is on the table in no time at all. The Jobox Magic Chopper is specifically designed to help you chop, slice, and dice vegetables and fruits to your heart's content, without having to waste time or energy! Finally you can chop, slice, dice and serve your guests just like a real professional chef!Our product is very easy to use! Put that knife away and use our magic chopper for all your cooking needs! To chop up vegetables all you need to do is place them on the stainless steel blades, and push down. They come out uniformly sliced or diced all the time! Not only does this revolutionary gadget save you time, space, money, and energy, but it also makes cutting onions a breeze, and thus saves you tears as well!Another benefit to using our machine is an easier clean up! You will not have a huge mess to clean up since all of your diced and chopped up vegetables or fruits are collected in the bowl. The collecting bowl can also be emptied out and used as a measuring cup to further aid you in your cooking activities. And any stray pieces that you may need to pick up is made easier to do so with our specialized clean up brush! Not having to gather vegetable and fruits pieces when you use the Jobox Magic Chopper means that you literally cut your preparation time in half! Easy in, easy out---that is the Jobox way! Features: Has 3 blades for chopping, slicing and dicing  Comes with Collector Bowl  Has Container Cover Dishwasher Safe","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/612101zd6aL._AC_SL1001_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Tiabo","source_asin":"B01DMFG8QY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822328","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01DMFG8QY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01DMFG8QY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
