window.products.push({"id":822394,"name":"Electric Kettle 1.8L with 12 Temp Control Up to 24 Hours Keep Warm Tea kettle Hot Water Boiler Stainless Steel Filter and Inner Lid Updated SpeedBoil ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFfHrhesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"24 HOURS KEEP WARM & 12-GEAR TEMP CONTROL: This electric kettle can keep your water warm for up to 24 hours, which helps save water and electricity for you and avoid excess minerals from multiple boiling water. Wide temp control range: 104℉-212℉. You can press the +/-button to adjust 9-degree per press for perfect results CONVENIENT TO USE: Easy operation with all controls on handle. With smart LED screen, the electric tea kettle hot water boiler supports temp readings as well as remaining working time readings. Clear glass and blue light let you always know how much liquid is inside and if it is boiling RAPID BOILING & LARGE CAPACITY: 1500W electric kettle speedily boils water in 3-6 mins; 1.8L large capacity of about 8 cups ( 250ml per cup ) can easily meet your daily needs of drinking and entertaining friends AUTO-OFF FUNCTION: The electric kettle water boiler is configurated British STRIX temp controller, which will auto turn off within 30 seconds after the water completely boils. And when it is detected that the water quantity in the kettle is too low, it will auto shut down SAFE & EASY TO CLEAN: The materials of the electric kettle tea kettle are made of 100% food-grade 304 stainless steel, borosilicate glass and BPA-free plastic. The top has a wide opening, perfect for reaching in to clean it thoroughly. To guard against scaling and corrosion, it is suggested to wash regularly and empty after each use","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71uFfHrhesL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Acekool","source_asin":"B09BC57F2Y","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822394","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09BC57F2Y","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09BC57F2Y","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822395,"name":"BINO 5-Piece Stainless Steel Kitchen Knives Set with Sheath - Speckled White | Chopping Knife | Serrated Utility Knife | Santoku Knife | Bread Knives ","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":11.49,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G1r8cR0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Time-Saving Kitchen Set: Comes with a special storage tray that can fit up to 5 knives and is designed to keep your knives hassle free and in prime condition. The set also has easy-to-grip handles for comfort when using to prepare meals. Stay Safe and Stay Sharp: Each kitchen knife in this set is made with high-quality stainless steel, making them incredibly sharp and durable. They are designed for comfortable and safe use, giving you years of dependable performance. The nonstick surface prevents food from sticking to the blades. Ergonomic Features : Ergonomically designed handles for a comfortable and secure grip for safer and easier cutting. The handles also have a non-slip design, allowing for maximum control and precision while cutting. The blade is made of stainless steel and is designed to maintain its sharpness for the life of the product. For Any Kind of Cooking: Using these knives, you will have complete control to precisely cut and slice vegetables, fruits, boneless meats, cheeses, and herbs. With a bread knife, you'll be able to make a clean cut through hard-crusted loaves quickly and easily. The Santoku knife is great for chopping and mincing quick and small items. Both the Santoku and Paring knives will let you finely shave off components for intricate details like peeling an orange, or peel slim juliennes of zucchini. Easy to Clean: This paring knife is designed for effortless and easy cleaning. Its stainless steel construction ensures a no-hassle cleaning experience.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71G1r8cR0PL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BINO","source_asin":"B0BRBPDZGS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822395","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BRBPDZGS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BRBPDZGS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
