window.products.push({"id":822507,"name":"NET POSITIVE Reusable Silicone Food Storage Bags (Snack, Sandwich, Storage Size 3 pack)","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vBI6y3nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Don’t give up on convenience. Say good-bye to wastefulness. NET POSITIVE Reusable Food Bags are 100% silicone and unlike other silicone food storage bags, ours have absolutely no plastic parts. Our silicone food storage bags are a joy to use and thoughtfully designed -- our pinch seal ACTUALLY stays shut; our pull tab makes it easy even for young snackers to open; wide base enables bag to stay upright (no spills!) Great for kids lunches and housewarming or graduation gifts, these are a kitchen staple for all. Invest in all three sizes -- reusable snack bag (6.5 ”H x 6.5” W; 17 oz), reusable sandwich bag (7” H x 8” W; 34 oz), and reusable kitchen storage bag (8.5” H x 10” W; 50 oz) -- so it’s easy to ditch your plastic bags. Perfect for refrigerator and freezer storage, lunches, and snacks on the go. Safe for dishwasher, microwave, and oven up to 400˚F. Even great as sous vide bags! Let’s eliminate single-use plastic together-- even our packaging (down to the stickers!) is 100% compostable -- we’re that serious about sustainability. You can feel great supporting a Chicago-based family business committed to developing Net Positive products.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71vBI6y3nuL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"NET POSITIVE","source_asin":"B07YBRRY3G","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822507","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07YBRRY3G","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07YBRRY3G","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822508,"name":"Professional Drafting Table - Black Frame, Cherry Surface, 48\" x 36\"","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SYPgpcGFL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","description":"Make our 48\" Professional Drafting Table the last drafting table you ever buy! Guaranteed for life, this classic, functional drafting table features a scratch-proof 48\" x 36\" surface constructed from high-temperature molecularly bonded wood and offers 45 degrees of adjustable tilt and a height adjustment range of 29\" to 40.\" Three premium grade, easy-to-turn knobs allow you to change the surface angle quickly, effortlessly, and as frequently as you want. The lower shelf is also independently height-adjustable and provides an additional 48\"x12\" platform perfect for storage. With eight attractive color combinations to choose from, we're confident you'll find the perfect one for your home or office.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61SYPgpcGFL._AC_SL1160_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"VERSATABLES","source_asin":"B002T602I8","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822508","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B002T602I8","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B002T602I8","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822509,"name":"Bush Furniture Key West 48W Writing Desk with 2 Drawer Lateral File Cabinet in Washed Gray","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":377.59,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y7RBJ-7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"A natural fit for many homes, the Bush Furniture Key West 48W Writing Desk and Lateral File Cabinet create a comfortable and spacious feeling, even in small areas. This Desk provides plenty of workspace with a cottage style motif featuring a unique X accent on the side panels for a relaxed and airy feel. The reclaimed Washed Gray finish pairs well with an attractive post leg design. The X accent carries over to the Lateral File Cabinet drawer panels in this complementing small office storage component that can also fit subtly in many rooms in your home. Enjoy full-extension ball bearing slides on the two file drawers for easy access to your letter or legal size folders. This Lateral File Cabinet has Aged Bronze handles and matches the height of the Writing Desk to create an extended workspace if placed side by side. Create an office as big or small as you want with the Key West Collection. Construction meets ANSI/SOHO standards for safety and performance and is backed by the Bush Furniture 1 Year Manufacturer's Warranty. See the full collection for coordinating items available.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71y7RBJ-7bL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Bush Furniture","source_asin":"B01IXFH52O","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822509","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01IXFH52O","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01IXFH52O","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822510,"name":"LIANLAM 1000 Thread Count Cotton Queen Size Sheets, Smooth Luxury Egyptian 100% Cotton Sheets, Cool Breathable Bed Sheets Set,16\" Elasticized Deep Poc","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+x2Cvu0PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"100% PURE COTTON FOR PREMIUM COMFORT & SOFTNESS: Experience the luxury and silky-soft feel brought together by 1000 threads woven per square inch with our premium Egyptian cotton like sheets. These 1000 thread count sheet sets are the perfect blend of breathability and durability, making them the ideal remedy for night sweats. 100% natural long staple cotton yarns are woven together using sateen weave to give you the ideal comfort and smoothness of 5-star hotel bedding. CERTIFIED GREEN WEAVING & DYEING: All our dyes, auxiliaries, and our sheets are OEKOTEX and GOTS certified to ensure your safety. LIANLAM sheets maintain sustainable & chemical-free. These ultra soft cotton cooling sheets are extremely safe for your health (and for our ocean too!). SNUG FIT:Looking for a fitted sheet in the 4-piece set that actually stays in its place and doesn't come off? Our fitted sheet comes with an all-around elastic to fit your mattress perfectly. The head/foot side indicator tells you how to make the bed easily. WHAT'S INCLUDE: Each Queen Size Sheet Set comes with 1× Fitted Sheet 60\"×80\"×16\" + 1× Flat Sheet 90\"×102\"+2× Pillowcases 20\"×30\". Care Guidance: Machine wash our 100% cotton queen size sheets in warm water and tumble dry on low heat, do not bleach. When machine drying, do not dry at high temperatures.LIANLAM cotton bed sheets will not fade, even after many machine washes. Pill-Proof & Odor-Free! Cotton tends to soften up with washing, so allow the sheets a couple washes to experience their silky softness. YOUR SATISFACTION IS IMPORTANT TO US: Along with superior comfort and luxury, our products also come with incredible customer service and 100% satisfaction guarantee. If you encounter any problems, you can contact us.Gift them to your loved ones and family or simply add them to your stunning room decor and enjoy bespoke californian luxury with our high quality sheets.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+x2Cvu0PL._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"LIANLAM","source_asin":"B09Z4YP6PY","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822510","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09Z4YP6PY","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09Z4YP6PY","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
