window.products.push({"id":822541,"name":"INSE Cordless Vacuum Cleaner, 30Kpa Lightweight Cordless Stick Vacuum Up to 60mins Runtime, 450W Rechargeable Battery Vacuum with LED Display, Powerfu","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":219.99,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616u9mnMcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"[450W 30Kpa Powerful Suction & Cordless Design] INSE Cordless vacuum cleaners feature 450W brushless motors that generate 30Kpa of powerful suction power in Max mode. The high-speed drive of the motor creates a super hurricane suction that can easily suck up large particles such as dog food, cat litter, debris, dust, hair, food residue, and other household waste! Besides marble, tile, hardwood floors, stairs, and cars, the stick vacuum works well on carpets as well. The super suction will provide you with an excellent cleaning experience! [60 Mins Long Runtime & Lightweight Design] With the large capacity, detachable & rechargeable 7x2500mAh battery, the cordless stick vacuum gives you up to 60 minutes of deep cleaning in standard mode. There are 3 suction modes on this vacuum cordless to meet your daily cleaning needs! A vacuum cleaner only weighs 3lbs, so it is perfect for one-handed cleaning. Regularly cleaning the HEPA filter will prevent weak suction and blockage. We offer a 12-month 100% satisfaction after-sales service for this floor vacuum! [LED Smart Display & One-Button Empty] The rechargeable cordless vacuum features a LED screen display, a suction control button, three suction & battery indicators, battery level, full dustbin & tangled roller alerts, this machine makes cleaning more easier and intelligent! By controlling the speed button on the led screen, the carpet stick vacuum adjusts suction modes at will. No dirt needs to be touched during emptying because of the one-click dust-dumping design. [Flexible Led Floor Brush & V-Shape Anti-tangle] Battery cordless stick vacuum with V-shaped roller brush with an anti-tangle design to avoid hair tangling. The V-shaped design makes messes concentrate on the suction port to be completely sucked up, thus improving the cleaning results. The pet hair vacuum cleaner floor brush with LED lights makes it easy to clean dirt under furniture or in hard-to-reach corners. A hardwood floor vacuum can be swiveled 180° sideways and 90° up and down to clean the entire house! [5-stages High-efficiency Filtration System] The stick vacuum cleaner cordless with the fully-sealed system can extend the machine's life. Multi-stage filters combine to capture 99.99% of particle dust as small as 0.1um, providing ultimate purified air for your family and preventing secondary pollution. A high-efficiency cyclonic cone can reduce the HEPA filter cleaning times, and provide 2x filtering performance than the common filtration system. Note: HEPA is unwashable, attached is an extra HEPA. [One-Line Cyclone Path] Compared with another vacuum cleaner cordless cyclone paths, INSE V120 cordless vacuum cleaners always keep powerful & high-efficient suction. There is no attenuation of suction power and it is brushed directly from the floor to the air outlet. Home cleaning is easy with ergonomic handles. For your family or friends who have pets or naughty kids, this lightweight stick vacuum would be the perfect gift. The entire room will be clean without any blind spots. [Multi-purpose & Easy to Use] The wireless vacuum is equipped with different attachments and provides ideal cleaning for virtually any scenario. It can switch to cordless handheld vacuums easily to clean sofas, cars, keyboards, and corners. Also, it can connect with a metal tube to clean high places or ceilings. With the Easy Rest design, you can safely prop up the vacuum against countertops and furniture. Your cleaning will become labor-saving and hassle-free with a 6-in-1 INSE cordless stick vacuum!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/616u9mnMcjL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"INSE","source_asin":"B09XXBBDKS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822541","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09XXBBDKS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09XXBBDKS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
