window.products.push({"id":822568,"name":"Art Wall Brooklyn Bridge at Sunset Gallery Wrapped Canvas Art by Linda Parker, 32 by 48-Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":96.72,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91C8Y4Gl03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Art Wall, Linda Parker 'Brooklyn Bridge at Sunset' Gallery-Wrapped Canvas is a high-quality canvas print depicting the famous Brooklyn Bridge on a particularly enchanting evening. A serene addition to your home or office. After having spent many years in the corporate canyons of Wall Street, both as a bond trader as well as an institutional salesperson, I traded in my pinstripe suits for a photographer's vest and enthusiastically swapped the regimented corporate arena for the creative field of photography. I was excited to finally have the time to work on my interest in photography and expand my creative side which was, for so long, put on hold. Before my recent move to the west valley in Arizona, I resided in NYC and studied at the International Center of Photography and the New School University. I have taken workshops from top photographers and comprehensive classes at both the Santa Fe Workshops and Toscana Photographic Workshop of Italy. I am a member of Professional Photographers of America, a photographic vendor for a major U.S. hotel organization and an Arbitrator for FINRA in which I serve on cases in matters of controversy relating to the securities industry. I love to capture on film the 'essence' of foreign regions--their people, their culture, their diversity. This, I feel, helps to enrich our lives and enlighten our minds. I am presently represented by several stock agencies and have been published in National Geographic Traveler, by the UK, German, Mexican and Spanish travel industries, as well as European, Chinese and South Korean media, to name a few. Although my current fine art pieces are impressionistic in style, my photographic eye and wide range of interests do not limit my 'vision of the world' to any one subject as you will see.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/91C8Y4Gl03L._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"ArtWall","source_asin":"B07CMJ8QBX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822568","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B07CMJ8QBX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B07CMJ8QBX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822569,"name":"KitchenAid 3-Ply Base Brushed Stainless Steel Nonstick Round Grill Pan/Griddle, 10.25 Inch","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+v8tWzWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Experiment with and discover new flavors and techniques when cooking with the KitchenAid 3-Ply Base Stainless Steel Nonstick Round Grill Pan, designed with an extra thick layer of heat-conducting aluminum to eliminate hot spots by distributing heat evenly from edge to edge. Heavy-gauge stainless steel stovetop grill pan features a heavy bottom induction base for lasting durability, and has raised ridges for that perfect steakhouse sear. Curious cooks can investigate a wider range of recipes in the oven, where cookware is safe to 500°F.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71+v8tWzWxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"KitchenAid","source_asin":"B08GDSR75K","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822569","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08GDSR75K","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08GDSR75K","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822570,"name":"Whitney Home Textile King Size Duvet Cover Set Yellow Pom Pom Duvet Cover Soft Breathable Farmhouse Washed Cotton Bedding 3 Pieces Boho Comforter Cove","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l7LDVrZ5S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","description":"[WHAT YOU CAN RECEIVE] KING SIZE DUVET COVER SET - 1 Bedding Duvet Cover (104\"x 90\"), 2 PillowCases (20\"x 36\"). WARM TIPS: that pillow insert, comforter, or duvet insert is not included. [ULTRA SOFT & COZY] Our premium bedding set is woven from the highest quality 100% washed microfiber material, breathable, and ultimate soft, and the touch feels smooth and comfortable. Superb yarn-dyed sewing ensures its fade-resistant and durable quality. Our luxuriously soft bedding will create a serene sleeping experience, keeps you comfortable all through the night, and you wake up feeling refreshed and rejuvenated. [CUTE & SIMPLE STYLE] Hand-woven tassels, blending into the natural, scattered drape, chic and beautiful, and add luster to your bedroom. With selected color, this pompoms duvet cover is brought to life with vitality. Minimalist pattern and exquisite craftsmanship, bring you a pleasant mood and unlimited visual enjoyment. Boho style ball fringe duvet cover set is a great gift choice for your loves, boys, girls, and kids. [ZIPPER CLOSURE & CORNER TIES] Our Bedding Duvet Cover features a hassle-free hidden zipper closure, easy to get your comforter in and out; 4 concealed tiebacks in the corners to secure your comforter in the right place from slipping into a pile and keep you comfortable all night long. [SPECIAL WASHING CARE] ①Please use a laundry bag or turn the whole duvet cover and put the pillowcase inside the duvet cover and close the zipper closure when you wash them, otherwise, the balls may be fallen! ②Please wash separately before first use, machine washes in cold water, gentle cycle, no bleach, tumble dry on a low-temperature heat or air dry, !!!Do not wash the duvet cover set with items that might hit the pompom.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71l7LDVrZ5S._AC_SL1200_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Whitney Home Textile","source_asin":"B08BLCNFRX","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822570","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B08BLCNFRX","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B08BLCNFRX","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
