window.products.push({"id":822660,"name":"Elegant Décor Fiber Comforter Oversize King ,1200TC 100% Microfiber, Premium Down Comforter for All Seasons (Size-Oversize King 108 Inches X 120 Inche","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wx-6toW2L._AC_.jpg","description":"This Comforter for home everyone in your family will love. We’re always dreaming up new ways to help you sleep well and get that extra bit of comfort throughout the day, all made for the way you live, priced for your budget, and delivered directly to you with a smile. Sleep in luxurious coziness and provide yourself with year-round warmth with this 400GSM with 1200 TC Down Alternative Comforter. Sewn through all the way, bed comforters hold up to wear and tear and have good resistance to shrinkage and wrinkles. It’s versatile enough to be used as a comforter alone or as a Comforter insert to match with your favorite Comforter. Filled with a 400GSM whole piece down alternative, this microfiber comforter makes a great alternative to traditional down comforter for those with sensitivities. Snuggle up in this soft, comfortable Microfiber Bedding! Filled with a premium 400 GSM down alternative, this comforter provides just the right in both warmer and cooler months. 100% microfiber comforters are machine washable for easy care: machine washes cold and tumbles dry low. The fabric is very soft and breathable, not noisy when you change position Easy Maintain The breathable Comforter is easy to maintain for year-round comfort. Just throw it into the washing machine the comforter will be Fluffy like new Soft & Comfortable: Made of High 1200 Series Brushed Microfiber Fabric, Fluffy comforter provides a smooth and gentle touch. No chemical smell. Zero noise for soundly sleeping. You can use it for 4 seasons, all year around.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51Wx-6toW2L._AC_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Elegant Decor","source_asin":"B09MKT4QXS","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822660","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B09MKT4QXS","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B09MKT4QXS","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
window.products.push({"id":822661,"name":"Clean Dirty Dishwasher Magnet Dishes Sign – Cute Elegant Quatrefoil Moroccan Trellis Modern Pattern – GREEN BLACK GREY – 3.5 x 2.5 – Housewarming, Bri","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71le8L+yfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"Are you having to closely inspect and/or sniff the contents of your dishwasher to know if dishes have been washed or cleaned? If you scrub and pre-rinse your dishes before you load them, it's going to be hard to tell. But with this Clean/Dirty Magnetic Dishwasher Indicator / sign for dish washers, you can end the guesswork and let everyone in your multi-member household / office / restaurant know with this simple magnet. Simply set to \"Clean\" once the wash cycle is turned on, or rotate to\"Dirty\" after clean dishes have been put away and dishwasher is ready for the new dirty load. Now you can rest assured that dishes are properly sanitized by your dishwasher before use. This clever kitchen or laundry gadget is cute, adorable and practical for your use. It's a great conversation starter and is a perfect complementing gift idea for New Homes, Housewarming Party, Wedding Day, Bridal Registry, Bridal Shower, practical guest favors & souvenirs, fun host / hostess gifts for New Year, July 4th, or Thanksgiving parties, Realtor clients appreciation token, nanny thank you, Mother's Day, Easter basket / Christmas stocking stuffers for men or women, that can also serve as an affectionate gag gift for Father's Day or for your chore-avoiding kids: daughter, son, sister or friend . Finally, teens (& others) avoiding the chore of putting away clean dishes will not have the excuse of not knowing whether the dishes are clean or dirty! Measuring 3.5 tall x 2.5 inches wide (our competitors mostly offer a smaller size), it's visible yet subtle sign. Small enough to be discreet, but big enough to see across the room with its large font and color coded spoon concept, and the stylish, attractive modern Moroccan Trellis design. Quick 2-Day Shipping is FREE with Amazon Prime with A-Z guarantee! Otherwise, you can get the same genuine product only from BeautifullyGifted! Click ADD TO CART and buy for yourself and your friends!","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/71le8L+yfFL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"BeautifullyGifted","source_asin":"B071XBCWG4","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822661","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B071XBCWG4","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B071XBCWG4","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
