window.products.push({"id":822914,"name":"French Baguette 8oz 100% Soy Candle","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":0.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81btBvstn2L._SL1406_.jpg","description":"French Baguette, the fresh smell of French bread takes you to the wonderful kitchens of Cajun Country in Louisiana. Smells like a fresh bakery. This candle offers the delicious smell without the calories. Know someone who loves French bread? This is the perfect gift. I make these to order. For best results they should “cure” two weeks before use. This means that you can use it before the date, however, for maximum scent when burned you should wait the full two weeks. I will add a label that has the date of the 2 week mark. 100% Soy Wax Candles Why should you choose soy candles? Great question! Here are some of the benefits that Soy Wax offers that others don’t: - Cleaner burn, they are slower burning, this means that no toxins, petrol-carbon soot or carcinogens, is produced into your home when you burn soy wax products. This is also gentler for people with allergies. - They last longer. They last, on average 30-40% longer than other waxes. My 8oz candles last, on average 40+ hours. This can vary depending on how long you light your candle to burn and if there is a draft near the candle. - Soy wax is a natural, renewable energy source. - Soy is derived from the soy bean, instead of paraffin wax which is derived from petroleum (a refined a gasoline product). - Soy wax is biodegradable, it cleans up with soap and water. Easy peasy for cleanup of any accidental spills of wax. - I use only Phthalate Free Fragrances. I do not add colorant to my soy wax candles, I can but I market them to be as natural as possible. I can add color upon request, keep in mind with the nature of soy wax most colors will be a pastel and not bold. I have over 200 fragrances, I’ve only added the most popular fragrances. If there is a particular scent that you would like contact me. If I do not have it, I can find it and make it for you. I have seasonal scents for holidays and different times of the year.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/81btBvstn2L._SL1406_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"Wonderland Exports Candles and Gifts","source_asin":"B01MDKTJRB","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822914","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B01MDKTJRB","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B01MDKTJRB","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
