window.products.push({"id":822986,"name":"autobot Car Vacuum Handheld Vacuum Cleaner Rechargeable 20000pa Powerful Suction Portable Cordless Lightweight Mini Vacuum for Car Pet Hair Home（VXmax","category":"homeandappliances","retail price":139.0,"sale price":null,"image":"https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+yDDV+FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","description":"【Elegant and Modern】 Stylish and Minimalist design, The AutoBot VX Max Cordless Handheld Vacuum Cleaner is made of Anodized aluminum and ABS which uses the most advanced 170W brushless motor，It has advantages of high efficiency, low noise, and long service life.Our Lightweight vacuum cleaner is durable anti-impact and designed for long-lasting use. 【20000 Pa Powerful suction】The Portable vacuum cleaner has three suction modes, the Power saving mode 7500pa can have a battery life of 50 minutes, and the mid-mode can reach 14000pa of 20 minutes, strong mode can reach 20000pa of 10 minutes.Easy to pick up wet cat litter, popcorn chicken and coin with Max 20000pa suction power, strong cleaning suction power beats the vast majority of all other handheld vacuums.Satisfy you to use in different places.（Ps：Can't be used on wet things） 【Special cyclone design】The Home vacuum had unique cyclone design not only maximizes the unobstructed flow of the filter element, relieves the clogging of the filter element, but also maintains the continuous suction power of the vacuum cleaner. It can keep the vacuum cleaner working with high efficiency and high suction power all the time.For the first time, a dust-air separation cyclone is introduced into a small, handheld vacuum cleaner. 【Overheating protection】The vacuum cleaner uses a memory chip independently developed by Autobot, which allows the vacuum cleaner to continue to protective role during work, and prevents the handheld vacuum cleaner from overheating and damaging the machine due to excessively long working time.As long as the time is too long, the vacuum cleaner will automatically stop working. Only need to wait for the internal parts to dissipate before continuing to use. 【4 in 1 Accessories】 Autobot car vacuum cordless rechargeable comes with 4 in 1accessories, which better get those hard-to-reach cracks to achieve an all-round treatment. With brush head and other accessories, it can instantly become a household vacuum cleaner, easy to assemble, and very convenient for daily household cleaning.It can easily remove the garbage in the corners of stairs, carpets, stoves, etc.","images":["https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61+yDDV+FZL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61zNIJh6ZCL._SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/61TWUez1VxL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51TIpnkrEpL._AC_SL1500_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/51I6jTu8yCL._AC_SL1300_.jpg","https://m.media-amazon.com/images/I/31o9GyU6jnL._AC_.jpg"],"specifications":{"brand":"autobot","source_asin":"B0BF4SGMMG","category_path":"Home & Kitchen"},"sku":"BM-822986","productType":"Home & Appliances","inventory":0,"age_group":"Adult","gender":"Unisex","source_url":"https://www.amazon.com/dp/B0BF4SGMMG","source_catalog":"Amazon Reviews 2023 product metadata","source_file":"meta_Home_and_Kitchen_2023.jsonl","source_asin":"B0BF4SGMMG","price_pending":true,"merchant_ready":false});
